{"path":"biology/genetics/mendel/epistasis-12-3-1","title":"显性上位 12:3:1（9+3 合并）","type":"example","html":"<p>某种植物花色由两对独立遗传的等位基因 A/a、B/b 控制：基因 A 对 B 的表达有<strong>显性上位</strong>作用——只要存在显性 A（A_A_ 型），花色为白色；当为 aa 时，B_B_ 开黄花，aabb 开蓝花。基因型为 AaBb 的植株自交，F₂ 中白色:黄色:蓝色为（ ）</p>\n<p>A. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12:3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>B. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9:3:4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>C. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13:3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>D. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>基因互作类型判别（选填三步）：9:7 互补；15:1 重叠；12:3:1 显性上位；13:3 抑制基因、9:3:4 隐性上位；9:6:1 累加；</li>\n<li>判据一句话：<strong>谁“吞”谁，就往谁的方向合并</strong>（本题 A 显性吞掉 B 的区分 ⇒ 9 和 3 归并）；</li>\n<li>变式（隐性上位）：若改为 <strong>aa 掩盖 B</strong>（隐性上位）⇒ A_B_(9) 红色、A_bb(3) 黄色、aa_ (3+1=4) 白色 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9:3:4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span>——注意 9:3:4 本质是“3+1 合并”；</li>\n<li>大题书写：“双显性与 A 单显均表现为白色，故白色占 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9+3=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span> 份…”——把合并逻辑写清楚。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>列出全部基因型组合</strong>（AaBb 自交标准展开，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9:3:3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双显性</strong>（A、B 均有显性等位基因，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span> 份）：有显性 A ⇒ 白色；</li>\n<li><strong>仅 A 显性</strong>（A 显性 + bb，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span> 份）：有显性 A ⇒ 白色；</li>\n<li><strong>仅 B 显性</strong>（aa + B 显性，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span> 份）：无显性 A、有显性 B ⇒ 黄色；</li>\n<li><strong>双隐性</strong>（aabb，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 份）：无显性 A 无显性 B ⇒ 蓝色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>合并</strong>：白色 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=9+3=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span> 份，黄色 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span> 份，蓝色 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 份 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12:3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：9331 变式判断 → <strong>“合并顺序”记忆法</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>9331 是母版，把 9 与某个 3 合并就是变式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>9+3 合并（显性上位）→ <strong>12:3:1</strong>；</li>\n<li>3+1 合并（双隐与单显同色）→ <strong>9:3:4</strong>；</li>\n<li>两个单显同色合并 → <strong>9:6:1</strong>；</li>\n<li>有显即表现 → <strong>15:1</strong>；</li>\n<li>抑制基因 → <strong>13:3</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>本题“有显性 A 无论 B 都白”= 9+3 合并 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12:3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>。<strong>20 秒选 A</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"某种植物花色由两对独立遗传的等位基因 A/a、B/b 控制：基因 A 对 B 的表达有 显性上位 作用——只要存在显性 A（A_A_ 型），花色为白色；当为 aa 时，B_B_ 开黄花，aabb 开蓝花。基因型为 AaBb 的植株自交，F₂","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"较难","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"12:3:1 是“显性上位”（A 有显性等位基因时掩盖 B 基因的效应）；与 13:3（抑制基因+双隐不同色）区分；判别看“哪 9+3 合并成一种表现型”。","fit":["F₂ 比例 12:3:1 / 13:3 / 9:7 等变式","判断基因互作类型","选填题"],"updated":"Wed Feb 26 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律"},{"slug":"epistasis-12-3-1","title":"显性上位 12:3:1（9+3 合并）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"epistasis-homozygous","title":"上位效应中的纯合比例（单显 1/3）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiment-design-multiple","title":"显隐性判断测交（全黑 vs 出现白）","type":"example"},{"slug":"gene-location","title":"基因定位实验（正反交判断）","type":"example"},{"slug":"genetic-9331","title":"9331 变式比例（拆分法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"lethal-ratio","title":"显性纯合致死比例（筛除 1/4）","type":"example"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"multi-gene-types","title":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"two-disease-prob","title":"常染色体+伴X 两病概率（拆分相乘）","type":"example"},{"slug":"two-gene-ratio","title":"两对基因概率（拆分法）","type":"example"}]}